Source: hestia-ivarse
Package: hestia-ivarse
Priority: optional
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Maintainer: I-Varse Technologies <dev@ivarse.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/puzzo-dev/hestiacp
Architecture: all
Depends: hestia (>= 1.10.0), curl, jq, tar, xz-utils, gnupg, gpgv, ca-certificates
Description: I-Varse application runtimes for Hestia Control Panel
 Adds first-class application hosting to HestiaCP: applications are managed
 as Hestia objects, supervised by systemd, and reverse-proxied by the
 existing web-domain machinery.
 .
 This package adds files alongside Hestia rather than replacing any part of
 it, so Hestia can be upgraded through its normal channels without
 disturbing anything installed here.
